WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:05.490
The upcoming Game of Thrones prequel series
that will air in 2022, House of the Dragon,

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:10.630
although based on George RR Martin's Targaryen
history book Fire &amp; Blood, will not feature

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:15.960
Targaryens only, but many other houses and
many other legendary figures from that time

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:21.490
period as well. Beside Targaryens, we will
have important Starks, Lannisters, Baratheons,

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:27.650
Tyrells but also Hightowers. Although Hightowers
existed in Game of Thrones as well, we had

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:32.320
no important Hightowers in it. In House of
the Dragon on the other hand, Hightowers play

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:38.219
the biggest role alongside Targaryens.
It's Otto Hightower (the Hand of the King)

00:00:38.219 --> 00:00:42.460
and his daughter Alicent Hightower
(wife of King Viserys Targaryen with whom

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:48.020
she has children) that basically started the
Dance of the Dragons, Targaryen civil war.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:52.380
The key event of the show is also the key
in the history of House Targaryen, the Dance

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:57.620
of the Dragons - the Targaryen civil war,
which divided the entire kingdom and launched

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:02.140
a huge war that was fought from 129 AC to
131 AC.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:06.850
House of the Dragon will start with a build-up
towards the Dance of the Dragons and early

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:12.499
seasons will cover the Dance itself. Ser Otto
Hightower was a knight from House Hightower

00:01:12.499 --> 00:01:17.820
who served as Hand of the King to three kings,
although two of the kings removed him from

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:23.569
office at various times. He was the younger
brother of Lord Hightower, and the uncle of

00:01:23.569 --> 00:01:29.599
Lord Ormund Hightower of Oldtown. His children
included Alicent Hightower, the second queen

00:01:29.599 --> 00:01:36.359
of King Viserys I Targaryen, and Ser Gwayne
Hightower, second in command of the gold cloaks.

00:01:36.359 --> 00:01:41.850
Otto is remembered as a warning that knowledge
is not everything. Otto Hightower fights or

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:48.859
should I say serves on the behalf of his grandson,
Aegon II Targaryens against Rhaenyra Targaryen.

00:01:48.859 --> 00:01:54.099
Ser Otto first served as Hand of the King
after the death of Prince Baelon Targaryen,

00:01:54.099 --> 00:02:00.380
the Hand and son of King Jaehaerys I Targaryen.
Otto effectively ruled the Seven Kingdoms

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:05.619
as Hand in the final two years of Jaehaerys's
reign, while his daughter, Alicent Hightower,

00:02:05.619 --> 00:02:11.510
nursed the ailing king. Otto continued as
Hand to Jaehaerys's grandson and successor

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:17.820
on the throne, Viserys I Targaryen. He became
a bitter rival of the king's brother, Prince

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:23.510
Daemon Targaryen, who had been named master
of coin. Otto convinced the king to remove

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:29.760
him from office and did so again when Viserys
named Daemon master of laws. He came to regret

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:35.409
this, however, when Daemon was named commander
of the City Watch, as this put two thousand

00:02:35.409 --> 00:02:41.219
men under Daemon's command and the prince
thrived in this new office. Otto feared Daemon

00:02:41.219 --> 00:02:46.650
would become a second Maegor the Cruel if
he ever ascended to the Iron Throne, sharing

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:52.409
his fears with his brother, the Lord of the
Hightower. Thus, by this time, Otto wished

00:02:52.409 --> 00:02:57.030
for Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen to succeed
her father. Otto's daughter Alicent became

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:05.630
King Viserys's second wife in 106 AC, after
the death of Queen Aemma Arryn. In 109 AC,

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:10.299
Otto was removed as the Hand for hounding
Viserys to declare Alicent's sons the heirs

00:03:10.299 --> 00:03:17.069
to the Iron Throne instead of Princess Rhaenyra.
Having no place at court anymore, Otto returned

00:03:17.069 --> 00:03:22.580
to Oldtown. A "queen's party", known as the
greens, the group of powerful lords who were

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:28.250
friends with Queen Alicent, remained, who
supported the rights of Alicent's sons. In

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:36.650
120 AC, Otto returned as Hand after Lord Lyonel
Strong died. When Viserys died in 129 AC,

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:42.040
Otto played a crucial role in crowning his
eldest grandson as King Aegon II in defiance

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:48.970
of the last will of Viserys I, which specified
Rhaenyra as the successor. This defiance precipitated

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:54.459
the civil war known as the Dance of the Dragons.
The Dance of the Dragons began with Otto serving

00:03:54.459 --> 00:04:01.170
as Hand of the King to Aegon II Targaryen.
According to Orwyle, Otto ordered the confinement

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:06.739
of Lord Lyman Beesbury in the black cells.
Ser Gwayne Hightower, Otto's son, was named

00:04:06.739 --> 00:04:12.939
as the second in command of the gold cloaks,
behind Ser Luthor Largent. The blacks, Rhaenyra

00:04:12.939 --> 00:04:18.610
Targaryen's faction opposing Aegon's greens,
included the battle-tested Prince Daemon Targaryen,

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:25.330
who, in the course of his pre-war adventures,
had made many foes, including Otto. After

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:30.210
the death of Prince Jaehaerys Targaryen at
the hands of Daemon's assassins, Blood and

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:36.310
Cheese, Aegon ordered deaths of King's Landing's
ratcatchers. Otto brought a hundred cats to

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:42.450
the Red Keep. Otto reached out to other enemies
of the prince Daemon, the Kingdom of the Three

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:47.150
Daughters, as allies. They were crucial in
breaking the Velaryon blockade in the Battle

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:52.750
of the Gullet. Otto was unsuccessful in gaining
an alliance with Qoren Martell, the Prince

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:59.750
of Dorne. King Aegon II told his grandfather
"Thrones are won with swords, not quills.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:06.020
Spill blood, not ink." Aegon II perceived
Otto's diplomacy as slothful at a time when

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:11.759
Prince Daemon had captured Harrenhal and many
houses had declared for the blacks. This led

00:05:11.759 --> 00:05:18.100
to Otto's replacement as the Hand by Ser Criston
Cole, the Lord Commander of the Kingsguard,

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:23.680
despite the pleading of Queen Alicent Hightower,
Otto's daughter and Aegon's mother. It was

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:30.349
only after his dismissal that Otto's diplomatic
efforts bore fruit. Just as he had predicted,

00:05:30.349 --> 00:05:35.390
Otto was the first to be beheaded as a traitor
by Rhaenyra after the fall of King's Landing

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:42.490
in 130 AC, which was not the end of the Targaryen
civil war, as Rhaenyra later loses Kings Landing,

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:48.040
but it was the end for Otto Hightower. Actor
Rhys Ifans will play a role of Otto Hightower

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:52.919
in House of the Dragon. HBO's official description
of the character reads:

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:58.539
"The Hand of the King, who loyally and faithfully
serves both his king and his realm. As the

00:05:58.539 --> 00:06:04.150
Hand sees it, the greatest threat to the realm
is the king's brother, Daemon, and his position

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:08.010
as heir to the throne."
The show will stay true to the books in this

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:13.150
matter, Otto's greatest rival in the books
was Prince Daemon Targaryen and he will also

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:18.319
be in the show. But most of the other things
however will differ from the books.

00:06:18.319 --> 00:06:22.220
Not only will there be differences between
the books and the show like it was with Game

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:27.080
of Thrones, but after reading the book Fire
And Blood, you still don't know how most of

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:30.810
the events really played out.
Some would think that you could just read

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:35.639
the book Fire &amp; Blood to know what will happen
in the show based on that very same book,

00:06:35.639 --> 00:06:40.889
but that’s far from true. Why? Because Fire
And Blood is not a conventional novel, it

00:06:40.889 --> 00:06:46.509
is an imaginary history book, and according
to George RR Martin himself, not very accurate

00:06:46.509 --> 00:06:51.930
at that. Because while Fire And blood book
was written by George RR Martin, it was not

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:57.130
written from him as facts, but rather through
the perspective of the Citadel's Archmaester

00:06:57.130 --> 00:07:02.190
Gyldayn who gathered all info and as many
different sources as he could and used it

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:07.831
to write a book about the Targaryen history.
Some info is fake, some info is true, some

00:07:07.831 --> 00:07:13.210
info is semi-true. No one will know for a
fact what was happening in real history until

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:19.240
the House of the Dragon airs in 2022.
The show unlike the book will contain truth,

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:24.710
it will depict what actually happened, not
the changed history, fake or semi-true, not

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:29.850
what might or might not have happened. Fire
&amp; Blood is a complete history of House Targaryen

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:35.690
written by George R. R. Martin from the perspective
of Archmaester Gyldayn who wrote it many decades

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:40.250
after the events took place. Sure, most of
the main events such as battles and deaths

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:46.150
probably did happen, but as Gyldayn says it
in the books, the full truth about what happened

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:52.020
behind closed doors, in the privacy of stairwells,
council rooms, and bedchambers he does not

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:58.280
fully know and he turns to many different
sources which usually differ from one another.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:03.760
He looks into the course of chronicles laid
down by Grand Maester Runciter and his successors

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:09.370
and many court documents as well. Gyldayn
looks into accounts written decades later

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:14.610
by children and grandchildren of those caught
up in the events of these times. While they

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:20.289
are undoubtedly of use, so much time has passed
between the event and the recording that many

00:08:20.289 --> 00:08:26.000
confusions and contradictions have inevitably
crept in.Unfortunately, this is also true

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:32.770
for Gyldayn's two accounts by firsthand observers
that have come down to him. Septon Eustace

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:37.460
who served in the royal sept in the Red Keep
during much of this time and spent much time

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:43.570
as a confidant and confessor to King Viserys
and his queens. His account is biased, favoring

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:48.770
Aegon II over Rhaenyra. The second account
is based upon a verbal account of the court

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:53.820
fool Mushroom who was present at court for
all of them; for King Viserys, Princess and

00:08:53.820 --> 00:09:01.130
Queen Rhaenyra and both King Aegons, the Second
and the Third. During his reign, King Baelor

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:06.620
I Targaryen had Mushroom's book burned on
account of its scandalous content. There are

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:11.630
several main sources for historical information
on the Dance of the Dragons, which are frequently

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:17.271
at odds with each other. Gyldayn also uses
source written by Grand Maester Orwyle, who

00:09:17.271 --> 00:09:20.380
had served King Aegon II Targaryen on his
council

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:26.900
and was arrested by the forces of Queen Rhaenyra
Targaryen when she took the city. Orwyle wrote

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:31.940
his account while locked away in the black
cells. Uncertain about whether or not he would

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:37.730
survive the war, he attempted to paint himself
in the best light possible. Grand Maester

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:42.871
Munkun's The Dance of the Dragons, A True
Telling was based on Orwyle's account. Using

00:09:42.871 --> 00:09:47.790
all these sources which often differ from
one another, archmaester Gyldayn wrote his

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:53.440
work, Fire And Blood, his work about the history
of House Targaryen. This format brings up

00:09:53.440 --> 00:10:00.030
Martin's major thematic point about the uncertainty
of memory, and history being written by winners.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:05.610
Neither side truly won the war, and decades
after the war, both sides wrote their own

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:11.200
biased history books trying to put their actions
in a better light. Thus histories written

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:17.410
by the Greens depict Aegon II in good light
and Rhaenyra in a bad light. On the other

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:21.900
hand, histories written by the Blacks do the
opposite. We'll know exactly what happened

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:26.460
in this time period when the show airs, and
that’s why you cannot just read the book

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:30.510
Fire And Blood and think you would know what
actually happened or what will happen on the

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:36.421
show. Books are written by Archmaester decades
and decades after the events took place, using

00:10:36.421 --> 00:10:41.800
many sources that in most cases are very different
from each other and most of them are biased

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:45.000
as well.
What we can tell you for a fact is that House

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:51.550
of the Dragon starts filming in around 3 weeks
and will air in 2022 on HBO. We can also tell

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:58.450
you that Otto Hightower will play a huge role.
He's the grandfather of Aegon II and he (alongside

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:04.600
his daughter Queen Alicent) starts Targaryen
civil war. The war began when King Viserys

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:10.900
I died, started by the Greens, Otto and Alicent
Hightower among others by disobeying King

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:17.080
Viserys' orders of crowning Rhaenyra and instead
crowning Aegon as the new King of Westeros.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:22.580
The same day that Viserys I died, Aegon II's
followers, the Greens, staged a coup, and

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:28.220
he was soon crowned in King's Landing. Rhaenyra,
as the Princess of Dragonstone, had her powerbase

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:33.370
on Dragonstone island, where she responded
by being crowned queen by Daemon and declaring

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:38.980
Aegon a traitor. Thus the Targaryen civil
war began. Thank you so much for watching,

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:41.660
hope you enjoyed this video and if you did
make sure to give it a big thumbs up and I

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:48.480
hope to see you in the next one, peace!

